how=intro('HOW THE QUADSTICK WORKS','My mouth.<br><em>My controller.</em>','A closer look at the setup that lets me jump into a match, explore a new world, and play alongside my friends.')
how+=f'''<section class="split setup-overview"><div class="device-image">{pic('quadstick','QuadStick controller showing the mouthpiece, joystick assembly, and tubing')}<span class="photo-label">A CLOSER LOOK AT THE CONTROLLER</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BASICS</p><h2>Here’s how I play.</h2><p>My QuadStick lets me play using my mouth. In my setup, I sip or puff through three main openings in the mouthpiece to activate different commands. Different combinations let me perform different actions.</p><p>I also move the joystick with my mouth and use a lip control beneath the mouthpiece that I activate with my bottom lip. I can customize the controls for different games.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.quadstick.com/">Explore official QuadStick information ↗</a></div></section><section class="controls-grid" aria-label="My controller inputs"><article><span class="control-number">01</span><h2>Sip &amp; puff</h2><p>Breathing in or out through the mouthpiece activates commands. Different combinations give me more options.</p></article><article><span class="control-number">02</span><h2>Move the joystick</h2><p>I move the joystick with my mouth. What that movement does depends on the controls I’ve set for the game.</p></article><article><span class="control-number">03</span><h2>Use my bottom lip</h2><p>The lip control gives me another input, right beneath the mouthpiece.</p></article></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEE IT IN ACTION</p><h2>From setup to gameplay.</h2></div></div><div class="video-grid two">{''.join(card(v) for v in tutorials)}</div><div class="coming-soon"><span class="eyebrow">CALL OF DUTY</span><h3>A dedicated controls walkthrough is coming soon.</h3><p>In the meantime, see the setup in action in my Call of Duty clips.</p><a class="text-link" href="/clips/?game=Call%20of%20Duty">Watch Call of Duty gameplay ↗</a></div><p class="small muted">These explanations describe my setup. Models, accessories, and compatibility vary; check the official QuadStick website for current product details.</p></section>{cta()}'''

